==Full energy restore==
Certain activities or actions will fully restore a player's energy and other attributes, these include:

*[[Death]]
*Drinking from a [[Revitalisation pool]] (or better) in a [[Player-owned house|POH]].
*Drinking from a [[Pool of Refreshment]] in the [[Ferox Enclave]].
*Exiting a duel in the [[Emir's Arena]].
*Entering and leaving the free-for-all [[Clan Wars]] portal.
*Entering and leaving the [[Chambers of Xeric]].
*Entering and leaving the [[Theatre of Blood]].
*Entering and leaving the [[Tombs of Amascut]].
*Activating the [[Magical Obelisk]] inside of [[Hallowed Sepulchre]] while wearing a Saradomin affiliated item and not wearing items affiliated with other gods.
*Accepting a cup of tea after completing a [[Mahogany Homes]] contract.
*Praying at the [[Elidinis Statuette]] in [[Nardah]] after completing [[Spirits of the Elid]].
*Inspecting a [[Strange shrine (The Stranglewood)|Strange shrine]] around [[The Stranglewood]].
*Drinking from a [[Strange Pool]] around [[Lassar Undercity]].
*Drinking a cup of tea from a [[cooking stove]] around [[Neypotzli]] dungeon.
*Interacting with the green [[Brazier (Ancient Guthixian Temple)|brazier]] in the [[Ancient Guthixian Temple]] during [[While Guthix Sleeps]], which also applies the effect of a [[Stamina potion]].
*Tagging the dispenser at the [[Wilderness Agility Course]].

